uppsala-domkyrka, uppsala-konserthus and uppsala-slott svg-files were AI-generated with Claude (Anthropic, Claude Sonnet 5.5)

Prompt for UKK: "Create a squared-shaped concerthouse with a small squared concaveness top right. 
The color should be white with blue stripes that indicates glass. In the middle it should be a dark blue horizontal strip."

Prompt for Cathedral: "Create a Cathedral with orange/red color and roof in black. It should have two towers to the left, one slightly bigger than the other one.
It should also have one smaller tower to the right coming from the opposite side"

Prompt for Castle: "Create a Castle in light-pink color. There should be two rounded towers, both to the left and to the right.
It should also have windows in three rows, both on the towers and building."

No human authorship claimed. Used under Anthropic's terms of service.